<title>USA: FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said it has qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Caldwell, N.J., $7.189 million improvement GOs.</p>
<p>--Lockport City, N.Y., $2.250 million public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Shelby County, Tenn., $70 million of GO public improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
